## Automation / wiring (§20.E)
- No new script. The change rewrites the `run:` body of one existing CI step and adds tests, an agents.d fragment and a changelog fragment.
- Entry point: `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, job `orchestrate-poll`, matrix group 3 (`if: strategy.job-index == 3`). It runs on every CI trigger the workflow already has.
- No long-running supervisor. A heartbeat loop runs inside the step, and an EXIT trap kills it when the step ends.
- No database work.
- No entry in `docs/scripts-pending-removal.md`: no single-use or long-running script is added.

